2026-10-13T16:23:46.3824164Z THE OFF-LIVE MESSAGE SURFACE + THE PROCESS FAR SIDE — DERIVED THIS RUN
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3825345Z ---------------------------------------------------------------------
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3826118Z   corpus            27980 def(s) over 1093 file(s); 33 live file(s)
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3826746Z                     (index built in 2997 ms)
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3827541Z   MESSAGE SURFACE   250 clause(s) — handle_info/2 + handle_params/3, by {name, arity}
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3828268Z     ON-LIVE         128 / 250, write-reaching 60 / 128 @6
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3829019Z                     — the half the census's lv_report_hole/5 already prints
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3829664Z     OFF-LIVE        122 / 250, write-reaching 61 / 122 @6
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3830386Z                     — NOT in that block's population: its membership test is
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3831763Z                     MapSet.member?(paths, d.path) over routed-live + component
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3832469Z                     files only, so no depth buys these back
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3833217Z   PROCESS FAR SIDE  122 clause(s) — handle_call/3 + handle_cast/2 + terminate/2
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3833896Z     OFF-LIVE        120 / 122, write-reaching 76 / 120 @6
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3834554Z                     — counted in NO census output at all today
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3834977Z 
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3835871Z   NEVER-COUNTED AND WRITE-REACHING: 137 clause(s) @6.
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3836270Z 
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3836856Z   FLOOR, REASON 1 — THE DEPTH BUDGET. 6 hops. A write further out is
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3837587Z   write-FALSE here and the number only rises with the budget.
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3838465Z   FLOOR, REASON 2 — THE PROCESS BOUNDARY. GenServer.call/cast is not an edge
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3839278Z   this resolver can build, so a caller's walk stops there; that is the whole
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3840020Z   reason the far side needs a denominator of its own.
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3840823Z   FLOOR, REASON 3 — THE FAN-OUT CAP. callees/2 takes at most 40 edges per def.
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3841919Z   FLOOR, REASON 4 — THE LIVE LENS. A live file here is a `use` shape; the
2026-10-13T16:23:46.3842737Z   census keys on ROUTED live modules + components, a SMALLER set. Under its
